          "type": 10,
          "content": "<:question:1543612105859670136> **Be patient**\n- We ask for your patience, as we aren't always able to respond immediately. There may be others ahead of you in the queue, meaning we are currently assisting other users."
        },
        {
          "type": 10,
          "content": "<:gold_nugget:1544521653780750416> **Do not ping staff**\n- Please do not ping the staff; our system notifies them automatically as soon as you open a ticket."
        },
        {
          "type": 10,
          "content": "<:HylexMC:1544517934167228507> **HylexMC Support**\n- We do not handle issues related to the HylexMC server here. If you need assistance from HylexMC staff, please go to their Discord server and open a ticket there."
